#. Translators: %(build)s and %(other)s are program files, such as xmltest3.exe and xmltest2.exe.
#: anno_modding_studio/core/xmltest.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(build)s crashed, so %(other)s answered instead: it does not add an <Asset> written straight under <ModOps>, and leaves some ModValues unworked, so a difference there may be that build's"
